        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "这是教导人们覆地之法，以便获得正气，正避开灾害并加以决断。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
